WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.723
Unit eleven. Caring for My Ears!

2
00:00:04.698 --> 00:00:08.519
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.569 --> 00:00:11.818
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:15.717
Today we learn about Caring for My Ears. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.263
Ears. Say it with me. Ears!

6
00:00:23.764 --> 00:00:27.198
Hear. Say it with me. Hear!

7
00:00:30.724 --> 00:00:34.291
Loud. Say it with me. Loud!

8
00:00:37.764 --> 00:00:41.231
Quiet. Say it with me. Quiet!

9
00:00:44.722 --> 00:00:47.855
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

10
00:00:51.358 --> 00:00:54.458
Water. Say it with me. Water!

11
00:00:57.968 --> 00:01:01.101
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

12
00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:08.021
Protect. Say it with me. Protect!

13
00:01:11.525 --> 00:01:21.275
My ears help me hear. Very loud noise can hurt my ears, so I protect them. I never put things inside my ears, and I tell an adult if my ear hurts so a doctor can check.

14
00:01:21.325 --> 00:01:22.525
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.924 --> 00:01:29.219
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.269 --> 00:01:30.419
Loud!

17
00:01:31.184 --> 00:01:36.473
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.523 --> 00:01:37.673
Doctor!

19
00:01:38.558 --> 00:01:45.097
Did you know? You should never put sticks or pens in your ears — they can hurt the inside of your ear!

20
00:01:45.147 --> 00:01:47.093
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.883 --> 00:01:55.275
Think and answer. What should you do if your ear hurts?

22
00:01:55.325 --> 00:01:56.475
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.453 --> 00:02:02.685
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.735 --> 00:02:05.494
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

